Make Totemic Call (HERO_02bp) follow the current Hearthstone rules:
- Patch 29.0 (2024-03): the basic totems are Searing, Stoneclaw, Wrath of Air
  and Healing (Wrath of Air CS2_052 replaced Strength Totem CS2_058).
- Patch 27.0 (2023-07): it can be used even if all four basic totems are on
  the board; then it summons one of the four at random. Totems not on the board
  are still preferred (user-approved case A10).

diff --git a/Sources/Rosetta/PlayMode/CardSets/LegacyCardsGen.cpp b/Sources/Rosetta/PlayMode/CardSets/LegacyCardsGen.cpp
